# Inside the Belly (otherAreas 26) with its era module, enabled by xi.pre(ABYSSEA) alone (RESTRICT_CONTENT 1,
# ENABLE_ABYSSEA 0; WotG, SoA and RoV on): the 2010 batch blocked; xi.pre(WOTG) is false, so Zaldon's trigger stays the
# quest's own.
# FISHING_ENABLE (P6): `setting map.FISHING_ENABLE true` in the header; every section reads xi.settings.map.FISHING_ENABLE == true
# (false in settings/default/map.lua).
# Completed (a GM), skill 40: the quest's 163 (with the Bladefish). A Gugru Tuna (the batch's first) and a Crocodilos (its
# last): nothing, kept. An Ahtapot (the 2009 batch, on): 166 or 167; a Matsya (SoA, on): 166 or 167.
module modules/era/lua/quests/otherareas/inside_the_belly.lua
lists Selbina/Zaldon/onTrigger Selbina/Zaldon/onTrade Selbina/onEventFinish/166 Selbina/onEventFinish/167
char zone=Selbina pos=-10.3,-7.287,-6.742 job=WAR lvl=30
setting map.FISHING_ENABLE true
setting RESTRICT_CONTENT 1
setting ENABLE_ABYSSEA 0
quest OtherAreas.InsideTheBelly completed
skill Fishing 400
item GugruTuna1
item Crocodilos
item Ahtapot
item Matsya
login
trigger Zaldon                          # the quest's own 163
finish
trade Zaldon GugruTuna1 x1              # blocked: nothing; kept
trade Zaldon Crocodilos x1              # blocked: nothing; kept
trade Zaldon Ahtapot x1                 # on: 166 or 167
finish                                  # 350 gil
trade Zaldon Matsya x1                  # on: <= 12: 166 (the Shaper's Shawl), else 167
finish                                  # 12592 gil
